---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About — ${SITE.author}`}
  description="Get to know indie author Madison Ilia—police dispatcher, licensed massage therapist, dog and horse mom, and writer of romantic suspense."
  activePage="about"
>
  <section class="section section-parchment">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-portrait-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/madison-eyes.jpg"
          alt="Close-up portrait of author Madison Ilia"
          width="800"
          height="1422"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="about-portrait"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="about-copy">
        <h1 class="about-heading">About <span class="accent-dark">Madison Ilia</span></h1>
        <p>
          I suppose a formal introduction is appropriate. I’m Madison Ilia. I live in a
          middle-of-nowhere town where the sun shines once a week if we’re lucky, we have more rocks
          than grass, and the trees have taken over; but it’s okay, we hold our own when we need to
          cut it.
        </p>

        <p>
          I talk too much, type even faster, laugh when I shouldn’t, drink too much coffee or{' '}
          <a href="https://wearerasa.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rasa</a>, and
          I’m allergic to red food coloring. The reaction is… more talking, faster walking, an
          overload of writing, and an unattainable amount of energy. If energy were sellable, I
          wouldn’t need my current day/night/overnight job (a little rotating shift humor).
        </p>

        <p>
          I love Jesus and strive to be the best version of myself every day; some days are better
          than others.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m the mother of a wonderful daughter. I’m also a dog mom, a horse mom, a sister, a
          daughter, an energetic individual, and a writer with plenty of words and never enough
          hours in the day to get them all down. I’m a police dispatcher most days, a sane person
          every once in a while, a licensed massage therapist when it suits me, and lastly, a book
          nerd. What writer do you know that doesn’t equally enjoy reading? One might say my
          interests are scattered all over the place, and I can’t say I’d correct them. I like to
          embrace life and experience as much of this beautiful world God created for us as I can!
        </p>

        <p>
          See, that wasn’t half bad. Subscribe to my newsletter for release dates and exclusive
          content only available to subscribers! I’m on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and Goodreads,
          and I check my email daily. Reach out if you feel so inclined; I’d love to hear from you!
          Stay blessed!
        </p>

        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="/novels.html" class="btn btn-primary">Current and Future Novels</a>
          <a href="/subscribe.html" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Subscribe to my newsletter</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="author-quote">
        <p>
          “Strength and courage are not present with the absence of fear. Merely that people and
          situations are and will be more important than fear alone. Through our weakest link we
          are strong. By love we possess our greatest weapon.”
        </p>
        <footer>{'(}—{) Madison Ilia'}</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .accent-dark {
    color: #9a6b3b;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 380px) 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-portrait-wrap {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .about-copy {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
  }

  .author-quote {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-night);
    color: var(--text-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .author-quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .author-quote footer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .about-copy p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .about-copy a {
    color: #8c5a2b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .about-portrait {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .about-portrait-wrap {
      order: 1;
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      flex: 0 0 76px;
    }

    .about-portrait {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      border-radius: 999px;
      object-position: center 22%;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
    }

    .about-copy {
      display: contents;
    }

    .about-heading {
      order: 2;
      flex: 1 1 0;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }

    .about-copy > p {
      order: 3;
      flex: 1 0 100%;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .author-quote {
      order: 4;
      flex: 1 0 100%;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .about-actions {
      order: 5;
      flex: 1 0 100%;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .about-actions .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
